Neither the receiver’s R nor the method’s S can be determined from the bool
result. Declare both on the generated function, preserving S’s constraint ~[]R,
and pass S explicitly in the call to Make.
-- config --
import-path: example.com/app
package-name: app
output: plumb_gen.go
-- example.com/app/app.go --
package app

type Factory[R any] struct{}

//plumb:build
func (Factory[R]) Make[S ~[]R](v S) bool { return true }
